# Garruk, Veiled Butcher's -3 on turn 3: each opponent discards two cards, and you draw a card for each opponent who did not
# discard two nonland cards. Bot2 discards two Ornithopters (two nonland cards), so Bot1 draws nothing: its hand is the three
# Forests left after turn 1 plus the turn-3 draw, 4. The control, where a land is discarded, is
# garruk-veiled-butcher-minus-three-draws-a-card-when-a-land-is-discarded. Loyalty 5 - 3 = 2.

